Package: ferrometer
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd
Description: Lightweight telemetry collector
 Ferrometer collects system metrics (CPU, memory, disk, network) and
 forwards them via OTLP HTTP to backends like VictoriaMetrics. Feature-
 flagged components keep the binary small. Designed as a lightweight
 alternative to Grafana Alloy / OpenTelemetry Collector.
